{"id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-language-decision.md","title":"Decidable Language","display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","aliases":["73-df-dtm-language-decision","73-df-decidable-language"],"display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-language-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-language-decision</span><span>73-df-decidable-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (deterministic Turing-machine class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (machine semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both membership and nonmembership force a halting outcome, so a decider halts on every input.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],